# Molitor Project - AI Assistant Context

## Project Structure Rules

### Backend (Laravel/PHP)
- Laravel packages location: `/packages/`
- Each package contains: `composer.json`, `src/`, `resources/`, `tests/`
- Use `/packages/` for all Laravel backend code

### Frontend (Vue.js/TypeScript)
- Vue packages location: `/resources/js/vue-packages/`
- Each package contains: `components/`, `views/`, `services/`, `types/`
- Use `/resources/js/vue-packages/` for all Vue and TypeScript code

### Examples
- Backend user package: `/packages/user/`
- Frontend user components: `/resources/js/vue-packages/vue-user/`
- Backend CMS: `/packages/cms/`
- Frontend admin: `/resources/js/vue-packages/vue-admin/`

## Quick Reference
- PHP/Laravel code → `/packages/[package-name]/src/`
- Vue/TypeScript code → `/resources/js/vue-packages/[package-name]/`
- Migrations → `/database/migrations/` or package-specific
- Routes → `/routes/` or package-specific
- Public assets → `/public/build/` (compiled by Vite)

